| Pin | v2 → v3 | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| `contract` | 2 → 3 | authored-inputs/action/bridge/session shapes change |
| `learnedPlan` | 2 → 3 | fill value gains `secretRef` |
| `observation` | 2 → 3 | `coverage.passwordControls` structural count (F-1); nodes unchanged |
| `guidedPolicy` | 2 → 3 | password-only + secret origin rule |
| `referencePolicy` | 3 → 4 | `ReplayRequirements` loses `accountRef`; `Policy3` → `Policy4` |
| `lowering` | 1 → 2 | lowerer emits `secretRef` recipes |
| `artifact` | 2 → 3 | `Artifact3` |
| `language` / `executor` | language `observed-2` → `observed-3`; executor `observed-2` → `observed-4` | secretRef execution plus fixed full Chromium/new-headless privacy policy; old observed-3 executor candidate is historical, not silently reinterpreted |
| profile `catalog` / `validator` / `protocol` / `replayAuthorization` / `accountAbi` | `observed-replay-3` / `observed-2` / 3 / 2 / **removed** | Fixed full Chromium/new-headless catalog; Launch/Execute IPC account ABI gone; old catalog remains historical |

